OL,3,ASpain's king and queen attend memorial
OL,4,Aservice for rail crash victims
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The tragic accident in Urda has left
OL,7,Four families, our towns and our society
OL,8,Fwith a pain that is difficult to
OL,9,Faccept," Archbishop Cerro Chaves told
OL,10,Fthose present.
